      "title": "FICO Q4'26 Earnings Call Highlights Pricing Uncertainty for FY27",
      "summary": "Fair Isaac Corporation (FICO) reported strong Q4 FY2026 earnings, beating estimates with $9.61 EPS and $657M revenue. However, management withheld FY27 guidance due to ongoing customized mortgage pricing negotiations and uncertain origination volumes. The company highlighted positive momentum in its software platform with 72% ARR growth to $453M and 84 lenders adopting Score 10T, while restructuring operations to focus on distribution and AI capabilities.",
